            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 11:20",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the three, he was more honourable than the two; for he was their captain: howbeit he attained not to the first three.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 108,
            "end": 113
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 11:21",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "Benaiah the son of Jehoiada, the son of a valiant man of Kabzeel, who had done many acts; he slew two lionlike men of Moab: also he went down and slew a lion in a pit in a snowy day.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 11:22",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "And he slew an Egyptian, a man of great stature, five cubits high; and in the Egyptian’s hand was a spear like a weaver’s beam; and he went down to him with a staff, and plucked the spear out of the Egyptian’s hand, and slew him with his own spear.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 39
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 97
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Chronicles 11:23",
        "book": "1 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 11,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "These things did Benaiah the son of Jehoiada, and had the name among the three mighties.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
